{"id":"fd5cc3818e5e9993","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-binary-oracle-decision.md","title":"Turing Reduction","display":"df-turing-reduction — Turing Reduction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-binary-oracle-decision","aliases":["73-df-binary-oracle-decision","73-df-turing-reduction"],"display":"df-turing-reduction — Turing Reduction","depends_on":["[[73-df-oracle-program-semantics]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-binary-oracle-decision"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-binary-oracle-decision</span><span>73-df-turing-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-turing-reduction — Turing Reduction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab6c7ca255afa826\" href=\"?note=ab6c7ca255afa826\" title=\"73-df-oracle-program-semantics\">73-df-oracle-program-semantics</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*\\)</span> (binary languages)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OTM}_B\">\\(\\operatorname{OTM}_B\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^B(O)\">\\(L^B(O)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OHalts}_O^B\">\\(\\operatorname{OHalts}_O^B\\)</span> (oracle-machine semantics, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab6c7ca255afa826\" href=\"?note=ab6c7ca255afa826\" title=\"73-df-oracle-program-semantics\">73-df-oracle-program-semantics</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\nA\\leq_T B\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists O\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{OTM}_B(O)\\land L^B(O)=A\n\\land\\forall w\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\;\\operatorname{OHalts}_O^B(w)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\nA\\leq_T B\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists O\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{OTM}_B(O)\\land L^B(O)=A\n\\land\\forall w\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\;\\operatorname{OHalts}_O^B(w)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The oracle machine computes the total characteristic decision for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> using membership queries to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>; recognizing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> without halting on negative inputs would be too weak.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-oracle-program-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"ab6c7ca255afa826","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-oracle-program-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-oracle-program-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"ab6c7ca255afa826","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{OTM}_B$, $L^B(O)$, and $\\operatorname{OHalts}_O^B$ (oracle-machine semantics, see [[73-df-oracle-program-semantics]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OTM}_B","display":false},{"tex":"L^B(O)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OHalts}_O^B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\nA\\leq_T B\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists O\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{OTM}_B(O)\\land L^B(O)=A\n\\land\\forall w\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\;\\operatorname{OHalts}_O^B(w)\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":962,"backlinks":[{"id":"25f120c26bfc86b7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["ab6c7ca255afa826"]}